## Where to start

Everyone comes to growing from a different direction. Here's a simple map:

**"I have a small space indoors and want to try one or two plants"** → Start with autoflowering seeds, a 2×2 tent, a basic LED, and quality potting soil. Guide coming soon.<!-- The [indoor growing guide](/growing-cannabis-indoors/) will walk you through setup step by step. {% comment %}pending-link{% /comment %} -->

**"I have a yard and want to grow outside this summer"** → You need to move quickly if it's spring — photoperiod plants need a full season. Grab feminized seeds suited to your climate. Guide coming soon.<!--  and read the [outdoor growing guide](/growing-cannabis-outdoors/). {% comment %}pending-link{% /comment %} -->

<!-- **"I'm not sure yet — indoor or outdoor?"** → Start with the [comparison article](/indoor-vs-outdoor-cannabis-growing/) and let your specific situation decide. {% comment %}pending-link{% /comment %} -->

**"I mainly want to grow for edibles and cooking"** → Everything above applies, plus the trim and lower buds from any plant are excellent infusion material. Our [edibles section](/edibles/cooking-with-cannabis-edibles-101/) covers what to do with your harvest.

